RFC 3161 fixture tokens for tests/tsa.rs: real TSA answers from 2026-10-28,
one from freetsa.org and one from DigiCert, kept as the TSAs returned them.
Per TSA: sample.tsr (the DER TimeStampResp as the TSA returned it),
sample.imprint.txt (the SHA-256 messageImprint it stamps, hex) and chain.pem
(the pinned chain, signer up to a self-signed root). Do not regenerate: a new
request would give different tokens and the tests pin these.
